<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal tax receipts up 9.6 pct yr/yr Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Portugal tax receipts up 9.6 pct yr/yr Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese tax receipts rose 9.6 percent year-on-year to 2,741 billion escudos in the first nine months, the Finance Ministry said.</p>
<p>In September, receipts were 351.1 billion.</p>
<p>Direct taxes rose 17.9 percent to 1,114 billion January-September. Indirect tax was up 4.5 percent at 1,540 billion.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
